1884+ 7BC5
1885+ 7BC5                  ; Avanza l'animazione ogni 2 frame (approx 25Hz per 8 stadi = ~0.32s)
1886+ 7BC5 21 AD E6         ld   hl, crumbling_anim_timer
1887+ 7BC8 34               inc  (hl)
1888+ 7BC9 7E               ld   a, (hl)
