 666+ 8560              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 667+ 8560              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 668+ 8560              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 669+ 8560              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 670+ 8560                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 671+ 8560                  ; Byte 2:
 672+ 8560 3A B0 E6         ld   a, (player_score + 2)
